        <mxCell id="note-text-1" value="&lt;b&gt;Amazon S3&lt;/b&gt; event notifications are the only trigger; nothing polls the bucket. Routing straight to &lt;b&gt;AWS Lambda&lt;/b&gt; is the cheapest option, while &lt;b&gt;Amazon EventBridge&lt;/b&gt; notifications would be the choice once more than one consumer needs the same upload event." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
