        <mxCell id="note-text-4" value="&lt;b&gt;Amazon DynamoDB&lt;/b&gt; is chosen because the access pattern is a single-item lookup by object key; on-demand capacity keeps the table&apos;s scaling behaviour aligned with the function&apos;s. A relational store would be the choice only if downstream queries needed joins." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
